**Issue**: #366
**Date**: 2026-09-05
**Status**: Approved
**Author**: NMG
**Related Spec**: specs/259-add-controller-owned-fresh-session-remediation-loops/

Feature: Repair implementation failures before stopping execute
  @SCN001 @regression
  Scenario: Resolve an in-scope missing implementation detail
    Given an approved issue with a missing internal component and a failing consumer test
    When the implementation worker handles the task
    Then it resolves the detail within the approved constraints
    And implements the component and reruns verification
    And does not demand external approval merely because the code is missing

  @SCN002 @regression
  Scenario: Continue recoverable implementation in a fresh session
    Given an implementation worker reports repairable failure with intervention false
    When execute consumes its settled handoff
    Then it starts rN-implement with the captured evidence and partial work
    And advances to review1 only after the original implement contract passes publication

  @SCN003 @regression
  Scenario: Preserve genuine authority and publication blockers
    Given the implementation requires unavailable external authority or unproven publication
    When available authorized repairs are exhausted
    Then it reports intervention true with exact missing prerequisites and attempts
    And never fabricates evidence or reports partial implementation as passed

  @SCN004 @regression
  Scenario: Reverify repeated repairs under original identity
    Given a fresh remediation session finds another repairable implementation defect
    When it reports that failure without intervention
    Then execute continues its existing fresh-session remediation loop
    And the eventual passed handoff retains step implement before review1
